next thing you know, long gun.

00:34:09.647 --> 00:34:10.915
- Yeah.

00:34:10.915 --> 00:34:12.450
So, you know, yeah, just
send them to my website,

00:34:12.450 --> 00:34:13.384
kirkcamero.com.

