00:34:20.425 --> 00:34:21.893
- Come on.

00:34:21.893 --> 00:34:23.027
- You're doing the s'mores?

00:34:23.027 --> 00:34:24.429
You're doing the s'mores?

00:34:24.429 --> 00:34:25.630
- I'm doing the s'mores.

00:34:25.630 --> 00:34:27.732
You know, if you got something

00:34:27.732 --> 00:34:29.300
