to have in your toolbox.

00:34:46.117 --> 00:34:48.853
It throws out about a
five, six foot flame,

00:34:48.853 --> 00:34:50.955
and it's awesome.

00:34:50.955 --> 00:34:52.590
- I will bring the meat.

00:34:52.590 --> 00:34:54.058
You bring the flame thrower.

00:34:54.058 --> 00:34:55.827
Keep the American
flag right there.

00:34:55.827 --> 00:34:57.161 align:start size:97% position:3%
Will be a hell of an evening.
